---
// FAQ section component
---

<section id="faq" class="py-20 bg-yellow-50">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 text-center mb-12">
      Frequently Asked Questions
    </h2>
    
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <!-- FAQ Item 1 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">What are the eligibility requirements?</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">Applicants should have a strong academic background in computer science, mathematics, or related fields, with demonstrated research experience and interest in cooperative AI.</p>
      </div>
      
      <!-- FAQ Item 2 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Is the fellowship open to international applicants?</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">Yes, the fellowship is open to applicants from around the world. We provide visa support and accommodation for international fellows.</p>
      </div>
      
      <!-- FAQ Item 3 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">What research topics can I work on?</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">Fellows can work on any of our nine research tracks, including AI for democracy, multi-agent security, cultural cooperation, and more. You'll be matched with mentors based on your interests.</p>
      </div>
      
      <!-- FAQ Item 4 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">What is the time commitment?</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">The fellowship is a full-time 6-month program. Fellows are expected to dedicate their full attention to research and program activities.</p>
      </div>
      
      <!-- FAQ Item 5 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">What support is provided?</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">Fellows receive a monthly stipend of R25,000, weekly mentorship sessions, visa support, accommodation (for international fellows), and access to research resources.</p>
      </div>
      
      <!-- FAQ Item 6 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Can I publish my research?</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">Yes, fellows are encouraged to publish their research findings. We provide support for paper writing and submission to relevant conferences and journals.</p>
      </div>
      
      <!-- FAQ Item 7 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">What happens after the fellowship?</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">Fellows become part of our alumni network and have opportunities for continued collaboration, research partnerships, and career development in the AI safety community.</p>
      </div>
      
      <!-- FAQ Item 8 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">How competitive is the application process?</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">The fellowship is highly competitive, with a limited number of positions available. We look for candidates with strong academic records, research experience, and genuine interest in cooperative AI.</p>
      </div>
      
      <!-- FAQ Item 9 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">What facilities are available?</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">Fellows have access to modern research facilities, computing resources, and collaborative workspaces in Cape Town. We also provide access to online research tools and databases.</p>
      </div>
      
      <!-- FAQ Item 10 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Is there a community aspect to the fellowship?</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">Yes, fellows participate in regular community events, workshops, and social activities. You'll be part of a diverse international community of researchers and practitioners.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Apply button at bottom right -->
    <div class="flex justify-end mt-12">
      <a href="#apply" class="inline-block bg-orange-500 hover:bg-orange-600 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-md text-lg font-semibold transition-colors duration-200">
        APPLY
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
